---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: "#5c7cfa"
    primaryTextColor: "#fff"
    lineColor: "#495057"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant DS as Dataset
    participant DL as DataLoader
    participant Aug as Augmentation
    participant M as Model
    participant L as Loss
    participant O as Optimizer
    participant E as Evaluator
    
    Note over DS,E: Training Loop (One Epoch)
    
    DL->>DS: Request batch
    DS->>DS: Load .mrc + .pdb files
    DS->>DL: Return (volume, features, label)
    
    DL->>Aug: Apply augmentation
    Aug->>Aug: Random rotation/flip/noise
    Aug->>DL: Augmented data
    
    DL->>M: Forward pass
    M->>M: Encode volume (U-Net/CNN)
    M->>M: Concatenate with PDB features
    M->>M: Classify
    M->>L: Predictions
    
    L->>L: Compute CrossEntropyLoss
    L->>O: Backward pass
    O->>O: Update weights (Adam)
    
    Note over DL,E: After each epoch
    
    DL->>E: Validation data
    E->>M: Evaluate (no grad)
    M->>E: Predictions
    E->>E: Compute metrics
    E-->>DL: Accuracy, Loss, F1-Score
    
    alt accuracy improved
        E->>E: Save checkpoint
    end
    
    alt early stopping triggered
        E-->>DL: Stop training
    end
